  "description": "<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-4o\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-id=\"300ca25a-62e6-405d-9ec7-35f39c2aad20\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div><hr><strong>&bull; Brand Introduction:</strong><br>Noble Ensemble is a luxury bedding brand dedicated to creating eco-friendly, high-quality bed sheets made from 100% organic bamboo. Our products are designed to deliver unmatched comfort, sustainability, and style, making them perfect for those who value a better night's sleep and a healthier planet.\r\n<p><strong>&bull; Product Description:</strong><br>Our signature product is a 5-piece set of premium bamboo bed sheets, crafted to provide a silky-smooth texture that feels luxurious against the skin. The set includes two pillowcases, a flat sheet, a fitted sheet, and a duvet cover. Designed specifically for hot sleepers, the sheets naturally regulate temperature, wick away moisture, and ensure a cool, refreshing sleep all night long.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made from 100% organic bamboo &ndash; soft, silky, and breathable</li>\r\n<li>Naturally antibacterial and deodorizing, promoting healthier skin and hair</li>\r\n<li>Perfect for hot sleepers &ndash; regulates temperature and wicks away moisture</li>\r\n<li>Sustainable and eco-friendly materials</li>\r\n<li>Luxurious 5-piece set, providing full bedding coverage</li>\r\n<li>Perfect house warming gift gor friends and loved ones</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>&bull; Payment Terms:</strong><br>Commission per sale will be paid via <strong>bank transfer</strong>. Payment is processed on a monthly basis.</p>\r\n<p><strong>&bull; Other Information:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Affiliates receive a complimentary 5-piece set to experience the product firsthand.</li>\r\n<li>Custom discount codes are provided to affiliates for their audience.</li>\r\n<li>Early access to new products and exclusive collaboration opportunities.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
